# ABox fixture for the deception-omission competency question (gmeow:cqDataFile overlay).
# Verbatim externalization of test_competency_deception_omission_query:
# an omission = held standpoint present, no projected standpoint.

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix exd:   <https://example.org/test/> .

exd:event1 a gmeow:Event ;
    gmeow:eventType gmeow:eventTypeOmission ;
    gmeow:heldStandpoint exd:claimA .

exd:claimA a gmeow:StandpointClaim .
